      "head": "{\"kind\":\"artifact\",\"artifact\":{\"title\":\"Stochastic Gradient Descent: Learning Rate and Batch Size on a Loss Bowl\",\"description\":\"A blue bowl-shaped surface with contour lines shows the loss for two model settings, x and z. Its lowest point is in the middle. A red ball is the current guess. Each step moves it by learning rate times a noisy mini-batch slope estimate, and an orange trail marks every step. An orange arrow shows the next mini-batch step and a grey arrow shows the full-data step. You can keep a finished run as a faded dark-blue ghost path. Readouts show the status, step number, loss and the length of the step arrow.\",\"experience\":\"experiment\",\"behavior\":\"rules\",\"controlProfile\":\"inspect\",\"stepped\":true,\"scene\":{\"materials\":[{\"id\":\"bowlBlue\",\"color\":\"#8fa8cc\"},{\"id\":\"ballRed\",\"color\":\"#d23c2a\"},{\"id\":\"pathOrange\",\"color\":\"#e8731a\"},{\"id\":\"keptBlue\",\"color\":\"#1f3a7a\"},{\"id\":\"slopeGrey\",\"color\":\"#555b63\"},{\"id\":\"markDark\",\"color\":\"#333a44\"}],\"geometries\":[{\"id\":\"bowlGrid\",\"kind\":\"surface\",\"width\":4,\"depth\":4,\"contours\":8,\"heights\":[[2.5,2.17,1.86,1.59,1.35,1.14,0.96,0.81,0.69,0.59,0.53,0.5,0.5,0.53,0.59,0.69,0.81,0.96,1.14,1.35,1.59,1.86,2.17,2.5],[2.42,2.09,1.78,1.51,1.27,1.06,0.88,0.73,0.61,0.51,0.45,0.42,0.42,0.45,0.51,0.61,0.73,0.88,1.06,1.27,1.51,1.78,2.09,2.42],[2.34,2.01,1.7,1.43,1.19,0.98,0.8,0.65,0.53,0.43,0.37,0.34,0.34,0.37,0.43,0.53,0.65,0.8,0.98,1.19,1.43,1.7,2.01,2.34],[2.27,1.94,1.63,1.36,1.12,0.91,0.73,0.58,0.46,0.36,0.3,0.27,0.27,0.3,0.36,0.46,0.58,0.73,0.91,1.12,1.36,1.63,1.94,2.27],[2.21,1.88,1.57,1.3,1.06,0.85,0.67,0.52,0.4,0.3,0.24,0.21,0.21,0.24,0.3,0.4,0.52,0.67,0.85,1.06,1.3,1.57,1.88,2.21],[2.16,1.83,1.52,1.25,1.01,0.8,0.62,0.47,0.35,0.25,0.19,0.16,0.16,0.19,0.25,0.35,0.47,0.62,0.8,1.01,1.25,1.52,1.83,2.16],[2.11,1.78,1.47,1.2,0.96,0.75,0.57,0.42,0.3,0.2,0.14,0.11,0.11,0.14,0.2,0.3,0.42,0.57,0.75,0.96,1.2,1.47,1.78,2.11],[